.TH PROFILES 1 2000-1月 "cut_profiles" "cut_profiles"
.SH NAME
cut_profiles \- Cut the catalog profiles by the profile value (usually the \fB-log10(p)\fR score).
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fIcut_profiles(\fBprofile\fR as <generic> CatalogProfiles, 
\fBvalueCut\fR as double);\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Cut the catalog profiles by the profile value (usually the \fB-log10(p)\fR score).
.PP
.SH OPTIONS
.PP
\fBprofile\fB \fR\- the catalog profiles object, for example the result of the \fBKEGG.enrichment.profile\fR function.. 
.PP
.PP
\fBvalueCut\fB \fR\- 
 the minimum profile value that a term should have, the terms with a smaller value
 will be removed from the catalog profiles.
. 
.PP
.SH VALUE
.PP
a new [CatalogProfiles](cref:T:SMRUCC.genomics.ComponentModel.Annotation.CatalogProfiles) object that only contains the terms with a value greater than or equals to the cutoff.
.PP
.SH SEE ALSO
profiles
